<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">ActiveVLN: Towards Active Exploration via 
<br class="ltx_break">Multi-Turn RL in Vision-and-Language Navigation
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zekai Zhang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
