<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">TABLE I</span>: </span><span id="S5.T1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Comparison of state-of-the-art methods on the R2R Val-Unseen split before and after post-training (DAgger or RL). <math id="S5.T1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>SR indicates the improvement in success rate (SR) after post-training. <sup id="S5.T1.9.1" class="ltx_sup">†</sup> denotes results obtained using only VLN-specific data to ensure a fair comparison.</span></figcaption>
