<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE IV</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance under the multi-turn and single-turn paradigms. RL post-training provides substantial improvements across all metrics in the multi-turn paradigm, while yielding only marginal gains in the single-turn paradigm.</span></figcaption>
